    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Peskit</strong>, you're a new hire at a sushi restaurant with a twist. Each order is generated by rolling dice. To serve it, you'll need to <strong>monitor the conveyor belt</strong>, <strong>grab the right sushi</strong>, and <strong>build the perfect box</strong>, all while maximizing your score through match-3 combos and strategic card choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game alternates between two key phases:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Shop Phase</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refine your deck</strong> by buying new sushi recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>sauces</strong> that act as wildcards or score multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen specific <strong>match-3 patterns</strong> by buying dominos with unique bonuses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf63 <strong>Service Phase</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll the dice</strong> to generate the customer's order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick sushi from the conveyor belt</strong> at the right time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place them in the box to <strong>trigger combos and boost your score</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peskit blends chance, precision, and tactical thinking into a fast-paced, flavorful loop. Perfect for fans of <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Slay the Spire</i>, or <i>Luck Be A Landlord</i> looking for something fresh and satisfying.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Peskit</strong>, you're a new hire at a sushi restaurant with a twist. Each order is generated by rolling dice. To serve it, you'll need to <strong>monitor the conveyor belt</strong>, <strong>grab the right sushi</strong>, and <strong>build the perfect box</strong>, all while maximizing your score through match-3 combos and strategic card choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game alternates between two key phases:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Shop Phase</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refine your deck</strong> by buying new sushi recipes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add <strong>sauces</strong> that act as wildcards or score multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen specific <strong>match-3 patterns</strong> by buying dominos with unique bonuses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf63 <strong>Service Phase</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll the dice</strong> to generate the customer's order</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick sushi from the conveyor belt</strong> at the right time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place them in the box to <strong>trigger combos and boost your score</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peskit blends chance, precision, and tactical thinking into a fast-paced, flavorful loop. Perfect for fans of <i>Balatro</i>, <i>Slay the Spire</i>, or <i>Luck Be A Landlord</i> looking for something fresh and satisfying.</p>",
    "short_description": "A unique roguelike deckbuilder: grab sushi from the conveyor belt, build boxes, and trigger powerful combos with sauces and dominos.",
